var SUITES=[['gb6','Geekbench 6'],['gb7','Geekbench 7'],['ai','Geekbench AI'],['cb26','Cinebench 2026'],['cb24','Cinebench 2024'],['llm','Local AI'],['xc','Xcode'],['bl','Blender'],['bl5','Blender 5.2'],['lp','Logic Pro'],['fc','Final Cut Pro'],['lr','Lightroom Classic'],['braw','Blackmagic RAW'],['disk','Internal SSD speed']];
var DEF_CHARTS=['gb6m','gb6g','cb26g','xc26','l512','f30','lr500','bcls','tps','dif','f3','dr'];
function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;'}[c];});}
function parseCSV(t){var r=[],row=[],f='',q=false,i,c;for(i=0;i<t.length;i++){c=t[i];if(q){if(c=='"'){if(t[i+1]=='"'){f+='"';i++;}else q=false;}else f+=c;}else if(c=='"')q=true;else if(c==','){row.push(f);f='';}else if(c=='\n'){row.push(f);r.push(row);row=[];f='';}else if(c!='\r')f+=c;}if(f!==''||row.length){row.push(f);r.push(row);}return r;}
function toSec(v){
  var s=String(v||'').toLowerCase().trim();if(!s)return null;
  if(/n\/a|ran out|estimat|\//.test(s))return null;
  s=s.replace(/,/g,'');
  if(/^\d*\.?\d+\s*s?$/.test(s))return parseFloat(s);
  if(s.indexOf(':')>=0){
    var p=s.replace(/[^\d:.]/g,'').split(':').map(parseFloat);
    if(p.some(isNaN))return null;
    if(p.length==3){ if(p[2]===0&&p[0]<60)return p[0]*60+p[1]; return p[0]*3600+p[1]*60+p[2]; }
    if(p.length==2)return p[0]*60+p[1];
    return null;
  }
  var re=/(\d*\.?\d+)\s*(ms|h|hr|min|m|sec|s)?/g,m,tot=0,last='',hit=false;
  while((m=re.exec(s))){var n=parseFloat(m[1]),u=m[2]||'';hit=true;
    if(u=='ms')tot+=n/1000;else if(u=='h'||u=='hr')tot+=n*3600;else if(u=='m'||u=='min')tot+=n*60;else if(u=='s'||u=='sec')tot+=n;
    else tot+=(last=='m'||last=='min')?n:(last=='h'||last=='hr')?n*60:n;
    last=u||last;}
  return hit?tot:null;
}
function toNum(v){var s=String(v||'').trim();if(!s||/n\/a|ran out|estimat|\//i.test(s))return null;var m=s.replace(/,/g,'').match(/-?\d*\.?\d+/);return m?parseFloat(m[0]):null;}
function fmtT(x){if(x<10)return (Math.round(x*100)/100)+' s';if(x<60)return (Math.round(x*10)/10)+' s';var h=Math.floor(x/3600),m=Math.floor((x%3600)/60),s=Math.round(x%60);if(s==60){m++;s=0;}return h?(h+'h '+m+'m'):(m+'m '+(s<10?'0':'')+s+'s');}
function fmtN(x,u){var d=x>=100?0:(x>=10?1:2);var n=Number(x.toFixed(d)).toLocaleString('en-US');return u?n+' '+u:n;}
function fmt(t,x){return t[6]=='time'?fmtT(x):fmtN(x,t[7]);}
function build(rows){
  var hi=-1;for(var i=0;i<rows.length;i++){if(/computer model/i.test(rows[i][0]||'')){hi=i;break;}}
  if(hi<0)return null;
  var lab=rows[hi],grp=[],g='',gr=hi>0?rows[hi-1]:[];
  for(var j=0;j<lab.length;j++){if(gr[j]&&gr[j].trim())g=gr[j].trim();grp.push(g);}
  var col={};T.forEach(function(t){var n=0;for(var j=7;j<lab.length;j++){if(!t[2].test(grp[j]))continue;if(t[3]&&!t[3].test(lab[j]||''))continue;if(n==t[4]){col[t[0]]=j;break;}n++;}});
  var find=function(re){for(var j=0;j<lab.length;j++)if(re.test(lab[j]||''))return j;return -1;};
  var ci={proc:find(/processor/i),ram:find(/^\s*ram\s*$/i),ssd:find(/^\s*ssd\s*$/i),gpu:find(/gpu cores/i)};
  return {rows:rows.slice(hi+1).filter(function(r){return (r[0]||'').trim();}),col:col,ci:ci};
}
function norm(s){return String(s||'').toLowerCase().replace(/["”″]/g,'').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim();}
function render(el,D){
  var want=(el.getAttribute('data-macs')||'').split('|').map(norm).filter(Boolean);
  var labels=(el.getAttribute('data-labels')||'').split('|');
  var macs=[];
  want.forEach(function(w,i){var nth=0,mm=w.match(/^(.*?)\s*#(\d+)$/);if(mm){w=mm[1];nth=parseInt(mm[2],10)-1;}var ex=D.rows.filter(function(x){return norm(x[0])==w;});if(!ex.length)ex=D.rows.filter(function(x){return norm(x[0]).indexOf(w)>=0;});var r=ex[nth]||null;
    if(r)macs.push({r:r,label:(labels[i]||r[0]).trim(),color:COLORS[macs.length%3]});});
  if(macs.length<2){el.innerHTML='';return;}
  var val=function(t,m){var j=D.col[t[0]];if(j==null)return {raw:'',v:null};var raw=(m.r[j]||'').trim();return {raw:raw,v:t[6]=='time'?toSec(raw):toNum(raw)};};
  var TT={};T.forEach(function(t){var vs=macs.map(function(m){return val(t,m);});var ok=vs.filter(function(x){return x.v!=null;});
    var best=null;if(ok.length>=2){best=t[6]=='time'?Math.min.apply(null,ok.map(function(x){return x.v;})):Math.max.apply(null,ok.map(function(x){return x.v;}));}
    TT[t[0]]={t:t,vs:vs,n:ok.length,best:best};});
  var near=function(o,x){return x.v!=null&&o.best!=null&&(o.t[6]=='time'?x.v/o.best:o.best/x.v)<1.03;};
  var gap=function(o){var ok=o.vs.filter(function(x){return x.v!=null;});if(ok.length<2||o.best<=0)return null;
    var top=[];o.vs.forEach(function(x,i){if(near(o,x))top.push(i);});
    var rest=ok.filter(function(x){return !near(o,x);});
    if(!rest.length)return {tie:true,top:top,txt:'about even'};
    var nx=o.t[6]=='time'?Math.min.apply(null,rest.map(function(x){return x.v;})):Math.max.apply(null,rest.map(function(x){return x.v;}));
    var r=o.t[6]=='time'?nx/o.best:o.best/nx;
    var w=(o.t[6]=='time'||o.t[7]=='tokens/sec'||o.t[7]=='fps')?'faster':(o.t[7]=='tracks'?'more':'higher');
    return {tie:false,top:top,txt:(r>=1.5?(Math.round(r*10)/10)+'× ':Math.round((r-1)*100)+'% ')+w};};
  var who=function(g){return g.top.map(function(i){return macs[i].label;}).join(' & ');};
  var dirTxt=function(t){return t[6]=='time'?'Lower is better':'Higher is better';};
  var sname=function(t){var sn='';SUITES.forEach(function(s){if(s[0]==t[1])sn=s[1];});return sn;};
  var cp=el.getAttribute('data-compact')=='1';
  var mdl=(el.getAttribute('data-model')||'').trim();
  var desc=function(t){var d=t[8]||'';if(d.indexOf('{m}')>=0){d=d.replace('{m}',mdl?mdl+' ':'');d=d.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+d.slice(1);}return d;};
  var view=cp?'charts':(el.getAttribute('data-view')||'all');
  var chart=function(k){var o=TT[k],t=o.t,sn=sname(t),g=gap(o);
    var mx=Math.max.apply(null,o.vs.filter(function(x){return x.v!=null;}).map(function(x){return x.v;}));
    var ttl=t[5];
    var s='<div class="vs-c" role="img" aria-label="'+esc(ttl+': '+o.vs.map(function(x,i){return macs[i].label+' '+(x.v==null?'not tested':fmt(t,x.v));}).join(', '))+'"><div class="vs-ct"><b>'+esc(ttl)+'</b><span>'+dirTxt(t)+'</span></div>'+(desc(t)?'<p class="vs-cd">'+esc(desc(t))+'</p>':'');
    o.vs.forEach(function(x,i){var m=macs[i];
      if(x.v==null){s+='<div class="vs-row"><div class="vs-rl">'+esc(m.label)+'</div><div class="vs-track"><span class="vs-na">'+esc(x.raw||'Not tested')+'</span></div></div>';return;}
      var w=Math.max(1,x.v/mx*100)*0.7;var win=g&&!g.tie&&g.top.length==1&&g.top[0]==i;var b=g&&!g.tie&&near(o,x);
      s+='<div class="vs-row"><div class="vs-rl">'+esc(m.label)+'</div><div class="vs-track" data-tip="'+esc(m.label+': '+fmt(t,x.v))+'"><div class="vs-bar" style="width:'+w.toFixed(1)+'%;background:'+m.color+'"></div><span class="vs-val'+(b?' best':'')+'">'+esc(fmt(t,x.v))+(win?'<i>'+esc(g.txt)+'</i>':'')+'</span></div></div>';});
    return s+'</div>';};
  var lw=Math.max.apply(null,macs.map(function(m){return m.label.length;}))*7.4+8;
  var h='<figure class="vs-fig'+(cp?' vs-cp':'')+'" style="--vs-lw:'+Math.round(Math.max(56,lw))+'px">';
  if(!cp){
    var title=el.getAttribute('data-title')||(macs.map(function(m){return m.label;}).join(' vs ')+': every test');
    var sub=macs.map(function(m){var r=m.r,sp=[];var ram=(r[D.ci.ram]||'').trim(),ssd=(r[D.ci.ssd]||'').trim();
      if(ram)sp.push(/gb/i.test(ram)?ram:ram+'GB');if(ssd)sp.push(/tb|gb/i.test(ssd)?ssd.toUpperCase():ssd+'GB');return m.label+' ('+sp.join(', ')+')';}).join(' vs ');
    h+='<div class="vs-hd"><p class="vs-h">'+esc(title)+'</p><p class="vs-sub">'+esc('As tested: '+sub)+'</p></div>';
  }
  if(view!='table'){
    var ck=(el.getAttribute('data-charts')||'').split(',').map(function(s){return s.trim();}).filter(Boolean);
    if(!ck.length)ck=DEF_CHARTS.filter(function(k){return TT[k]&&TT[k].n>=2;}).slice(0,4);
    ck=ck.filter(function(k){return TT[k]&&TT[k].n>=2;});
    if(ck.length)h+='<div class="vs-grid">'+ck.map(chart).join('')+'</div>';
  }
  if(view!='charts'){
    var ts=(el.getAttribute('data-tests')||'').split(',').map(function(s){return s.trim();}).filter(Boolean);
    var th='<thead><tr><th>Test</th>'+macs.map(function(m){return '<th>'+esc(m.label)+'</th>';}).join('')+'<th>Difference</th></tr></thead>';
    var tb='',cnt=0;
    SUITES.forEach(function(s){if(ts.length&&ts.indexOf(s[0])<0)return;var rs=T.filter(function(t){return t[1]==s[0]&&TT[t[0]].n>=2;});if(!rs.length)return;
      var kinds={};rs.forEach(function(t){kinds[t[6]]=1;});var mixed=Object.keys(kinds).length>1;
      tb+='<tr class="vs-g"><td colspan="'+(macs.length+2)+'">'+esc(s[1])+(mixed?'':' · '+dirTxt(rs[0]).toLowerCase())+'</td></tr>';
      rs.forEach(function(t){var o=TT[t[0]],g=gap(o);cnt++;var tn=t[5].indexOf(': ')>0?t[5].split(': ').slice(1).join(': '):t[5];tn=tn.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+tn.slice(1);tb+='<tr><td>'+esc(tn)+(mixed?' <span class="vs-u">('+dirTxt(t).toLowerCase()+')</span>':'')+'</td>';
        o.vs.forEach(function(x){if(x.v==null){tb+='<td class="na">'+esc(x.raw?x.raw:'—')+'</td>';return;}tb+='<td'+(g&&!g.tie&&near(o,x)?' class="best"':'')+'>'+esc(fmt(t,x.v))+'</td>';});
        tb+='<td class="dif">'+(g?(g.tie?'About even':esc(who(g)+', '+g.txt)):'')+'</td></tr>';});});
    if(tb)h+='<details class="vs-all"'+(view=='table'?' open':'')+'><summary>Every test result ('+cnt+')</summary><div class="vs-tw"><table class="vs-t">'+th+'<tbody>'+tb+'</tbody></table></div></details>';
  }
  if(!cp)h+='<p class="vs-src">From my own testing. <a href="/mac-tests/">See every Mac I\'ve tested</a></p>';
  h+='</figure>';
  el.innerHTML=h;
}
var tip;function ensureTip(){if(!tip){tip=document.createElement('div');tip.className='vs-tip';var host=document.querySelector('.att-vs');(host||document.body).appendChild(tip);}return tip;}
document.addEventListener('mousemove',function(e){var t=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.att-vs [data-tip]');if(!t){if(tip)tip.style.display='none';return;}var d=ensureTip();d.textContent=t.getAttribute('data-tip');d.style.display='block';d.style.left=Math.min(e.clientX+14,window.innerWidth-270)+'px';d.style.top=(e.clientY+14)+'px';});
function run(){var C=window.__attVsCSV||{},cache={};document.querySelectorAll('.att-vs[data-doc]').forEach(function(el){var k=el.getAttribute('data-doc');if(!(k in cache)){cache[k]=C[k]?build(parseCSV(C[k])):null;}
  if(cache[k])try{render(el,cache[k]);}catch(e){el.innerHTML='';if(window.console)console.error('att-vs',e);}else el.innerHTML='';});}
if(document.readyState=='loading')document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',run);else run();
})();
